/image/jaoe38c1lzterkym/6623efd8-598f-4fb0-9b5f-9a0ca7147669/a9e638d0-59fd-11ef-a471-47315abdd89b/file-jaoe38c1lzterkyn.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/jaoe38c1lzterkym/6623efd8-598f-4fb0-9b5f-9a0ca7147669/a9e638d0-59fd-11ef-a471-47315abdd89b/file-jaoe38c1lzterkyn.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/jaoe38c1lzterkym/6623efd8-598f-4fb0-9b5f-9a0ca7147669/a9e638d0-59fd-11ef-a471-47315abdd89b/file-jaoe38c1lzterkyn.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>Here we will apply the concept of energy conservation and concept of SHM.</p>\n<p>We know that for elastic collision, coefficient of restitution, e = 1</p>\n<p>Hence, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.045ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"25.68ex\" height=\"2.646ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -707.2 11350.6 1169.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D452\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D452\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(743.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1799.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(856.9,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"Te